## Interface: 120100, 120105
## Title: XayaUI Game Data Capture
## Notes: Separate debugging tool for XayaUI. Pulls every class, spec, talent, spell description, spellbook entry, gear and set-bonus line the game will give an addon, and records which auras each cast causes (with observed durations). Developer captures: a full inventory of the game's API in this client, live checks for the Character Toolkit, a catalogue of every aura current content points to, and an aura log. Opens from XayaUI > Settings > Debugging or with /xuidump.
## Author: Xaya
## Group: XayaUI
## Version: 0.5.0
## X-Date: 2026-11-04
## SavedVariables: XayaUIGameDumpDB
## OptionalDeps: XayaUI

GameDump.lua
ApiInventory.lua
AuraCatalogue.lua
FormulaCapture.lua
